OL,3,ASeven planes searched after suspected
OL,4,Abomb threats across Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven flights have been searched after
OL,7,Flanding in Europe, following a series
OL,8,Fof bomb threats
OL,10,FTwo Ryanair planes were searched after
OL,11,Flanding in Rome, with one - flying from
OL,12,FDublin - escorted by the Italian Air
OL,13,FForce. No explosives have been found on
OL,14,Fany of the planes
OL,16,FAnother two flights were inspected in
OL,17,FWarsaw, including one that was diverted
OL,18,Fafter setting off from London Heathrow
OL,19,F- another two landed in Sofia
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
